#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:13
msgid "data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"atlas_oe_acid\"]"
msgstr ""
"Name: Acidic Origins\n"
"Type: Hostile (Nebula)\n"
"Unique: True\n"
"Dominant Faction: The Acidic Growth\n"
"Rebel Threat Level: Low\n"
"Locations of Interest: Central Acidic Shipyards\n"
"    \n"
"The Acidic Origins are a dangerous place, only the most extreme ships survive the Acidic nebula, and that isn't even considering trying to survive the Acidic ships themselves."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:22
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_BILL_unlock\"]"
msgstr ""
"Consult the advice of a certain Acidic Castaway about a certain artifact to "
"unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:24
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_unlock\"]"
msgstr "Help an Acidic Castaway to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:25
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_2_unlock\"]"
msgstr "Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Cruiser Type A to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:26
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_ARTY_3_unlock\"]"
msgstr ""
"Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Cruiser Type B or beat the game with the "
"Acidic Cruiser Type A to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:28
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_unlock\"]"
msgstr "Find the central shipyards of the Acidic Growth to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:29
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_2_unlock\"]"
msgstr "Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Destroyer Type A to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:30
msgid ""
"data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"ship_PLAYER_SHIP_OE_ACID_LONG_3_unlock\"]"
msgstr ""
"Get to Sector 5 with the Acidic Destroyer Type B or beat the game with the "
"Acidic Destroyer Type A to unlock this ship."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:32
msgid "data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"renegade_discover_oe_acid\"]"
msgstr ""
"From out of the tunnel comes a massive cruiser vessel, of Acidic Growth "
"design! Boasting an unusually large weapon arsenal even by Growth standards,"
" this ship must be one of the few vessels to ever pick up multiversal "
"travel, leaving their familiar nebulae behind."

#: src-en/data/text_misc.xml.append:33
msgid "data/text_misc.xml.append$//text[@name=\"renegade_intro_oe_acid\"]"
msgstr ""
"\"The outsiders. Intruding, taking, killing. In our home. Now, we, "
"outsiders. Now, we invade. We take. We kill. Surrender, not. Run, or die: is"
" all we allow.\""
